 "summary": "A single small-signal Schottky barrier diode in the two-lead SOD-323 surface-mount package. It blocks 40 V repetitive peak reverse voltage, carries 30 mA average forward current, and drops at most 0.37 V at 1 mA. Terminal capacitance is 2 pF typical at 1 V reverse bias, 1 MHz. It is intended for low-voltage, high-frequency signal circuits.",
